<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>大多数美国人赞成对被判谋杀罪的人判处死刑</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/08/06/most-americans-favor-the-death-penalty-for-those-convicted-of-murder/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/pp_2026-8-6_death-penalty_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;虽然 68% 的人认为对谋杀犯判处死刑在道德上是合理的，但 59% 的人表示死刑并不能阻止严重犯罪——而且在这两个问题上都存在巨大的党派分歧。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/08/06/most-americans-favor-the-death-penalty-for-those-convicted-of-murder/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的工作支持率低于历史标准</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/trumps-job-approval-rating-is-low-by-historical-standards/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.06_historic-ratings_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;特朗普的工作支持率为 34%，低于历任总统的同等水平，党派差距达 78 个百分点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/trumps-job-approval-rating-is-low-by-historical-standards/</guid></item><item><title>自 1990 年以来任命的大多数美国参议员都通过竞选来保住自己的席位，而且大多数都获胜了</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/most-us-senators-appointed-since-1990-have-run-to-keep-their-seat-and-most-have-won/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.06_senate_appt_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;自1990年以来，美国参议院已任命了43名议员，其中27名（63%）通过竞选保住了席位。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/most-us-senators-appointed-since-1990-have-run-to-keep-their-seat-and-most-have-won/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对中期选举的公正性和准确性有多少信心？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.05_midterm_voting_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;超过一半的美国人相信 2026 年中期选举将是公平的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 13:30:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对在美国学校学习语言有何看法？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/03/what-do-americans-think-about-language-learning-in-us-schools/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.03_foreign-language_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;十分之四的美国人表示，对于在美国长大的孩子来说，学习英语以外的语言极其或非常重要。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 01:24:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/03/what-do-americans-think-about-language-learning-in-us-schools/</guid></item></channel></rss>